.SH NAME
le-restart - Restart a listener via its owner (brew services / docker)


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBle restart [port|pid] [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Bounce a brew-managed or Dockerised listener through its real owner —
no kill -9 surprises. Only managed listeners can be restarted; anything
else has no supervisor to bounce it through.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for restart


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBle(1)\fP


